# 🔥 11. Time Complexity

This is probably the **most important part**.

| Operation       | C++ `vector` | C++ `list` | C++ `deque` | Java `ArrayList` | Java `LinkedList` | Java `ArrayDeque` | Python `list` | Python `deque` |
| --------------- | -----------: | ---------: | ----------: | ---------------: | ----------------: | ----------------: | ------------: | -------------: |
| Access by index |         O(1) |       O(n) |        O(1) |             O(1) |              O(n) |                 ❌ |          O(1) |           O(n) |
| Add back        |        O(1)* |       O(1) |        O(1) |            O(1)* |              O(1) |              O(1) |         O(1)* |           O(1) |
| Remove back     |         O(1) |       O(1) |        O(1) |             O(1) |              O(1) |              O(1) |          O(1) |           O(1) |
| Add front       |         O(n) |       O(1) |        O(1) |             O(n) |              O(1) |              O(1) |          O(n) |           O(1) |
| Remove front    |         O(n) |       O(1) |        O(1) |             O(n) |              O(1) |              O(1) |          O(n) |           O(1) |

`*` Amortized O(1).

### 🧠 The big picture

```text
VECTOR / ARRAYLIST / PYTHON LIST
          ↓
   Fast index access
          ↓
        O(1)

LIST / LINKEDLIST
          ↓
   Fast insertion/removal
   when position/node is known
          ↓
        O(1)

DEQUE / ARRAYDEQUE
          ↓
   Fast operations at
      BOTH ENDS
          ↓
        O(1)
```

