# 🔥 12. Simple Example

Suppose we want:

```text
Add 10 at front
Add 20 at back
Add 5 at front
Remove from back
```

### C++

```cpp
deque<int> dq;

dq.push_front(10);
dq.push_back(20);
dq.push_front(5);

dq.pop_back();
```

Final:

```text
[5, 10]
```

### Java

```java
Deque<Integer> dq = new ArrayDeque<>();

dq.addFirst(10);
dq.addLast(20);
dq.addFirst(5);

dq.removeLast();
```

Final:

```text
[5, 10]
```

### Python

```python
from collections import deque

dq = deque()

dq.appendleft(10)
dq.append(20)
dq.appendleft(5)

dq.pop()
```

Final:

```text
[5, 10]
```

Same **concept**, different **method names**. 🔥

